#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
Polyglot - Universal Compiler Driver (v0.2.0)

A single-file driver that discovers and drives clang / GCC toolchains:
build, run, check, IR/ASM emission, formatting, linting, JIT, static
analysis, incremental caching and more.  Backend-aware: the same user
interface works over clang or GCC, translating flags as needed.

Requires only the Python 3 standard library plus the 'toml' package.
"""

